# Docs: specs and plans stay uncommitted

`docs/superpowers/` is gitignored on purpose.

- **Do not commit** design specs (`docs/superpowers/specs/`) or implementation plans (`docs/superpowers/plans/`).
- **Do not** `git add -f` those paths to bypass `.gitignore`.
- Writing specs/plans to disk is fine; leave them untracked.
- Application code: user owns commit/push (see `no-git-commit-push`).
